      "type": "text",
      "text": "Give as needed for partial- or full-thickness burns. A toxoid booster if fully vaccinated with no booster in the past 5 years; tetanus immune globulin (human) 250 units IM, with the toxoid, ONLY if the primary series is incomplete or unknown (also with HIV or severe immunodeficiency, regardless of history) (CDC; a remote booster just needs the toxoid)"
     }
    ]
   }
